// CRIME SCENE -- a one-room noir point-and-click.
// Detective Frank Malone walks the ransacked office of murdered reporter
// Arthur Kessler, collects three clues pointing at Halcyon Pharmaceuticals,
// and leaves with a lead. See PLAN.md.
import room

// 640x480 canvas in a 1280x960 window: every canvas pixel is drawn 2x2 (pixel
// art stays crisp, subtitles render at the window's resolution), and on a
// Retina screen the window is 640x480 points instead of a quarter of that.
default window 1280 960

// ESC pause menu: the screen dimmed by 30% (a black quad as big as the
// screen) under the engine-provided Save / Load / Exit list.
ui optionsMenu
    quad color=0,0,0,0.3
    grid items=$options cols=1 anchor=center padding=20
        text $item.label click=$item.callback

func entry
    font efmi
    call crimeScene
